      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1791592776930,
      "created": 1791585368209,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1. Database & Models;\n- Create models, establish relationships , and apply indexes to 'updated_at'\nand 'chat_id'\n\n2. Backend APIs;\n- Implement FastAPI routes for fetching summaries, single chats, and\nappending messages.\n\n3. Frontend UI\n- Build React Sidebar, ChatWindow and handling empty loading state",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1. Database & Models;\n- Create models, establish relationships , and apply indexes to 'updated_at' and 'chat_id'\n\n2. Backend APIs;\n- Implement FastAPI routes for fetching summaries, single chats, and appending messages.\n\n3. Frontend UI\n- Build React Sidebar, ChatWindow and handling empty loading state",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
