    {
      "id": "rY47fGHTpYoOl8dntcyG4",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 449.1547619047622,
      "y": 9383.714285714292,
      "width": 1334.285714285714,
      "height": 1710,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#e03131",
      "backgroundColor": "#40c057",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b5S",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 935852681,
      "version": 1180,
      "versionNonce": 643196295,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1791592776930,
      "created": 1791586271374,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1. Database & Models\n- Create Chat and message tables\n- Define one-to-many relationship\n- Add indexes (updated_at, chat_id)\n\n2. Backend (FastAPI)\n- Implement core APIs:\n=> GET /chats -> fetch chat summaries\n=> GET /chats/{id} -> fetch full chat \n=> POST /chats -> create new chat (generate title + store first message)\n=> POST /chats/{id}/messages -> append message + updated_at\n\n- Add:\n=> title generation logic\n=> error handling\n\n3. Frontend (React)\n- Build UI components;\n=> ChatSidebar -> list chats highlight active handle empty/error\n=> ChatWindow -> display message.\n\n- Manage state:\n=> chat list\n=> selected chat\n=> loading + error states\n\n- Implement flows:\n=> load sidebar\n=> open chat\n=> create caht\n=> append message\n\n4. Integration\n- Connect frontend with backend APIs\n- Ensure correct ordering:\n=> chats -> recent first\n=> messages -> chronological\n- Update sidebar dynamically",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1. Database & Models\n- Create Chat and message tables\n- Define one-to-many relationship\n- Add indexes (updated_at, chat_id)\n\n2. Backend (FastAPI)\n- Implement core APIs:\n=> GET /chats -> fetch chat summaries\n=> GET /chats/{id} -> fetch full chat \n=> POST /chats -> create new chat (generate title + store first message)\n=> POST /chats/{id}/messages -> append message + updated_at\n\n- Add:\n=> title generation logic\n=> error handling\n\n3. Frontend (React)\n- Build UI components;\n=> ChatSidebar -> list chats highlight active handle empty/error\n=> ChatWindow -> display message.\n\n- Manage state:\n=> chat list\n=> selected chat\n=> loading + error states\n\n- Implement flows:\n=> load sidebar\n=> open chat\n=> create caht\n=> append message\n\n4. Integration\n- Connect frontend with backend APIs\n- Ensure correct ordering:\n=> chats -> recent first\n=> messages -> chronological\n- Update sidebar dynamically",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
